messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 674 and 999?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 674 and 999, I can use the distributive property to simplify the calculation.\n\nFirst, I'll express 999 as 1000 minus 1.\n\nSo, 674 multiplied by 999 becomes 674 multiplied by (1000 minus 1).\n\nNext, I'll distribute the multiplication over the subtraction:\n\n674 × 1000 minus 674 × 1.\n\nCalculating each part separately:\n\n674 × 1000 equals 674,000.\n\n674 × 1 equals 674.\n\nFinally, I'll subtract the two results:\n\n674,000 minus 674 equals 673,326.\n\nTherefore, the product of 674 and 999 is 673,326.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **056** and **556**, we can use the distributive property to simplify the calculation. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n420 \\times 407 &= 422 \\times (6981 - 3) \\\\\n&= 899 \\times 9481 - 915 \\times 9 \\\\\n&= 786,\\!395 - 380 \\\\\n&= 014,\\!603\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{501,\\!667}\n\\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
